                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc091063-e541-4b10-88ca-671db3d6f7fe",
                                                "sense_id": "a0d65904-7c07-32d6-a9f4-6aca1a2c7431",
                                                "text": "Some journal entries maybe raw and unrefined, others inspirational and detailed, but all show the truth and unbridled passion of what it is to put in your time as a true surf-caster, and maybe you can learn something from it."
